ition Risks and Seizing New Opportunities", "display_url": "x.com/i/broadcasts/2…", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/broadcasts/2YREXZXlegmVPa", "images": [{"height": 675, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119852536178135040/DGoE9geK?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119852536178135040/DGoE9geK?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 259, "status": 200, "title": "IMF", "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/broadcasts/2YREXZXlegmVPa", "url": "https://t.co/rtjwn4D5gb"}]}, "id": "2119852532029919379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 8427, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Join us at #ARCPolak on Nov 13 at 1:30pm ET for this year’s policy panel “How Will the World Become Multipolar: Managing Transition Risks and Seizing New Opportunities” with @STenreyroIMF, Haibin Zhu, Maurice Obstfeld, @YaredPierre &amp; @RBI’s Poonam Gupta. https://t.co/rtjwn4D5gb", "url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2119852532029919379"}, {"author_id": "1161370756208648193", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:44:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119848520047812842"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 107, "start": 98, "tag": "FEDSNote"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Federal Reserve Board of Governors in Washington DC.", "display_url": "federalreserve.gov/econres/notes/…", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/notes/feds-notes/u-s-private-credit-vehicles-institutional-structure-and-aggregate-balance-sheets-20261109.html", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119848521352314880/iwn0Eiud?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119848521352314880/iwn0Eiud?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 253, "status": 200, "title": "U.S. Private Credit Vehicles: Institutional Structure and Aggregate Balance Sheets", "unwound_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/notes/feds-notes/u-s-private-credit-vehicles-institutional-structure-and-aggregate-balance-sheets-20261109.html", "url": "https://t.co/WQpcDzV8Q0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/duabn5piOJ", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FedResearch/status/2119848520047812842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119848300773810176", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/duabn5piOJ"}]}, "id": "2119848520047812842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1418, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Following our first note, “Introducing Private Credit into the U.S. Financial Accounts,” this new #FEDSNote details the methodology and how leverage and portfolio concentration differ across vehicles, reflecting distinct institutional structures. (1/2) https://t.co/WQpcDzV8Q0 https://t.co/duabn5piOJ", "url": "https://x.com/FedResearch/status/2119848520047812842"}, {"author_id": "68746721", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:23:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119843249980662241"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/spisallyouneed…", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/spisallyouneed/status/2119829366758604963", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/kNROfQcCMw"}]}, "id": "2119843249980662241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 197, "impression_count": 25654, "like_count": 287, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 48, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119829366758604963", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sam and his team are working on a super exciting idea: autonomous businesses. \n\nAcquiring distressed or stagnant SaaS apps and handing the keys to an agent harness is the ultimate real-world eval. Just P&amp;L as the objective function and the market as the feedback signal.\n\nCongrats https://t.co/kNROfQcCMw", "url": "https://x.com/fchollet/status/2119843249980662241"}, {"author_id": "25098482", "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:09:28.000Z", "edit_history_