"NEW YORK—The Federal Reserve Bank of New York’s Center for Microeconomic Data today released the October 2026 Survey of Consumer Expectations, which shows that households’ inflation expectations remained unchanged at the short-, medium-, and longer-term horizons. Labor market expectations were mixed with unemployment and job loss expectations deteriorating, while job finding expectations improved. Expectations of an increase in unemployment reached the highest level since April 2020. Conversely, job", "display_url": "nyfed.org/4zUiuXH", "end": 199, "expanded_url": "https://nyfed.org/4zUiuXH", "start": 176, "status": 200, "title": "Inflation Expectations Stable; Labor Market Expectations Mixed - FEDERAL RESERVE BANK of NEW YORK", "unwound_url": "https://www.newyorkfed.org/newsevents/news/research/2026/20261109", "url": "https://t.co/NmK29wVlT5"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/lKBbQdV1sN", "end": 223, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NewYorkFed/status/2119825280063647916/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119825269758242817", "start": 200, "url": "https://t.co/lKBbQdV1sN"}]}, "id": "2119825280063647916", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1627, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Our October 2026 Survey of Consumer Expectations shows that households’ inflation expectations remained unchanged at the short-, medium-, and longer-term horizons. Learn more:\nhttps://t.co/NmK29wVlT5 https://t.co/lKBbQdV1sN", "url": "https://x.com/NewYorkFed/status/2119825280063647916"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-09T15:49:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119819796338409478"], "id": "2119819796338409478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 30761, "like_count": 173, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "Thanks to newly released data, we now have a handle on the scale of the Japanese government's FX interventions to support the yen.\nActing on behalf of the Ministry of Finance, the Bank of Japan deployed a total of ¥15.39 trillion (nearly $100 billion) in the third quarter alone.", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2119819796338409478"}, {"author_id": "25098482", "created_at": "2026-11-09T15:32:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119815285729603827"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 47, "id": "399958787", "start": 31, "username": "Bank_of_Japan_e"}], "urls": [{"description": "Kazuo Ueda, Governor, Bank of Japan Dr. Kazuo Ueda was appointed Governor of the Bank of Japan in April 2023. He started his career as an assistant professor in the Department of Economics at the University of British Columbia in 1980. In 1982, he became an associate professor at Osaka University, and in 1993 he became a professor at the University of Tokyo, specializing in macroeconomics and financial theory. From 1998 to 2005, he was a member of the Bank of Japan's Policy Board, the central bank's", "display_url": "imf.org/en/news/semina…", "end": 241, "expanded_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/news/seminars/conferences/2026/06/24/2026-michel-camdessus-central-banking-lecture", "images": [{"height": 405, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117398879968862208/08qZKYzn?format=png&name=orig", "width": 400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117398879968862208/08qZKYzn?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 218, "status": 200, "title": "2026 Michel Camdessus Central Banking Lecture", "unwound_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/news/seminars/conferences/2026/06/24/2026-michel-camdessus-central-banking-lecture", "url": "https://t.co/N6P6VueY7P"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/p8GxSloJ8o", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2119815285729603827/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119815277269651456", "start": 242, "url": "https://t.co/p8GxSloJ8o"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/p8GxSloJ8o", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2119815285729603827/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119815